<title>POLAND: DEBICA AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 10.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 10.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.35 vs   3.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.64 vs   6.47</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.97 vs   7.12</p>
<p> Sales		   46.87 vs  43.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    26.98 vs  29.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	46.85 vs  43.27</p>
<p> Operating profit    34.86 vs  50.34</p>
<p> Sales		  401.37 vs 320.77</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Firma Oponiarska</p>
<p>Debica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
